		<item>
		<title>About Express Yourself vs Born This Way Spread the message till stays in history as the fact that it is.</title>
		<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/luv/about-express-yourself-vs-born-this-way-spread-the-message-till-stays-in-history-as-the-fact-that-it-is/82</link>
		<comments>http://drownedmadonna.com/luv/about-express-yourself-vs-born-this-way-spread-the-message-till-stays-in-history-as-the-fact-that-it-is/82#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Fri, 13 Jan 2012 02:15:05 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator>Chris_P</dc:creator>
				<category><![CDATA[Web]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Born This Way]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Express Yourself]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Gaga]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[madonna]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/luv/about-express-yourself-vs-born-this-way-spread-the-message-till-stays-in-history-as-the-fact-that-it-is/82</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[It  is not only the chords progression that is the same. The way she has put her message into words, and the way their lyrics are structured, are completely the same; the way it tries to be universal and the way it starts intimate or personal and goes on to sound like a political or [...]]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>It  is not only the chords progression that is the same. The way she has put her message into words, and the way their lyrics are structured, are completely the same; the way it tries to be universal and the way it starts intimate or personal and goes on to sound like a political or religious preach on the chorus for example. Same goes for the way the melodies in the song sound, somewhere between a hollywood/cabaret/camp/drag act, a military march and a gospel chorus.<br />
The very essence of what Express Yourself was as a song, besides its literal message, is the exact same thing that BTW is in essence creatively, conceptually and musically. Everything from vocal style, to structure and chord progression, to the specific mixture and balance of styles and attitudes is exactly the same.<br />
They are as similar on all aspects as it gets. The only thing that would be more similar to Express Yourself is Express Yourself.Now, all that is left, is Madonna singing Express Yourself over the Born This Way instrumental and Born This Way over the Express Yourself instrumental for her tour… It’s her song after all! <img src='http://drownedmadonna.com/luv/wp-includes/images/smilies/icon_smile.gif' alt=':)' class='wp-smiley' /> <br />
I mean, I LOVE Gaga, but let&#8217;s not hide behind our fingers any longer, just because most Little Monsters are bullies.<br />
She can title the remixes Born Your Self and Express This Way!!! <img src='http://drownedmadonna.com/luv/wp-includes/images/smilies/icon_razz.gif' alt=':P' class='wp-smiley' /> </p>
]]></content:encoded>
